     "<div style=\"border:0px;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:12pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:black;direction:ltr\"><b>Quoting from a separate email conversation:</b></div><div style=\"border:0px;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:12pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:black;direction:ltr\"><br></div><div style=\"border:0px;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:12pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:black;direction:ltr\"><i>&quot;I have been working on the data and have part of the skyline files ready. I tried to visualize those in <a href=\"https://msstatsshiny.com/app/MSstatsShiny\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://msstatsshiny.com/app/MSstatsShiny&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793230458912000&amp;usg=AOvVaw03ezdXfpMFgideJf0OAg5u\">MSstatsShiny</a>, but there was a file size limitation of 250mb, while my files were closer to 500mb. I was able to surpass the limit by running MSstatsShiny on my laptop, but now when I try to upload the files, MSstatsShiny just seems to load forever. I believe the files are too big for the program. Have you heard of this problem? <span style=\"font-size:12pt\">Have you any ideas for refining the data or otherwise reducing the file size?&quot;</span></i></div><div style=\"border:0px;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:12pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:black;direction:ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><br></span></div><div style=\"border:0px;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:12pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:black;direction:ltr\"><b>If anyone has any issues uploading files on MSstatsShiny on your laptop, there may be two potential problems:</b></div><div style=\"border:0px;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:12pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:black;direction:ltr\"><ul style=\"color:rgb(36,36,36);font-size:15px\"><li style=\"color:black;font-size:12pt;list-style:&quot;- &quot;\"><div style=\"border:0px;font:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\">You may have ran out of RAM space: this could occur if you&#39;re running other applications.  I know on Windows, you can halt those applications on Task Manager.</div></li><li style=\"color:black;font-size:12pt;list-style:&quot;- &quot;\"><div style=\"border:0px;font:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\">You ran out of space in your temporary files folder: I know on Windows, you can check the Disk Cleanup application and delete &quot;Temporary files&quot;.</div></li></ul><div>Tony</div></div>"
